OL,4,BCummins' integrity not compromised - CA
OL,5,GCricket Australia has "unequivocally   
OL,6,Grejected" the suggestion that captain  
OL,7,GPat Cummins' integrity has been        
OL,8,Gcompromised by the sandpaper scandal.  
OL,10,FOn Saturday CA gave its "unanimous     
OL,11,Fsupport" to Cummins, and he said he    
OL,12,Fwould take part in the independent     
OL,13,Fforum set up for players and staff.    
